<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37105" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξελ-ιγμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>countermarching,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Μακεδονικός, Λακωνικός, Κρητικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				10.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				23.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐπὶ τῶν ἵππων ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1.2b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>doubling,</i> of the hare, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				16.3
			</span></i> (pl.); so of <i>turning</i> movements in walking or
			driving a hoop, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.21.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				26.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>revolution</i> of the heavenly bodies, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. of the
				<i>shortest period containing a whole number of synodic months,
				days, and</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκαταστάσεις</span> of the moon, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				18.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				4.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
